nue and Steeles Avenue...\" Yes.\n\nThus answer \"Steeles Avenue\"."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1549,"completion_tokens":433,"total_tokens":1982,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791971425,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}